      "promptZhHans": "小杰在计算一个多项式减去2x²-3x+1时，误将减法看成了加法，得到的结果是5x²+2x-3。请你求出正确的计算结果。",
      "optionsZhHans": [],
      "answer": "x²+8x-5",
      "acceptedAnswers": [
        "x²+8x-5"
      ],
      "explanationZhHans": "设原多项式为A，根据错误运算有A+(2x²-3x+1)=5x²+2x-3，所以A=(5x²+2x-3)-(2x²-3x+1)=5x²+2x-3-2x²+3x-1=3x²+5x-4。正确的计算应为A-(2x²-3x+1)=(3x²+5x-4)-(2x²-3x+1)=3x²+5x-4-2x²+3x-1=x²+8x-5。答案为x²+8x-5。",
      "sourceDistanceStatus": "passed",
      "mathQaStatus": "needs-review",
      "reviewNotes": "deepseek-original-v3-1200; pending-s18-manual-review"
    },
